],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Gage County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 35% of normal in January to February and 33% in February to March, then April to May 2026 came in at 136%. Grid 24133 had its driest year in 1974 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
